{"id": 1009330, "slug": "ink-enigma-hidden-object-challenges", "name": "INK ENIGMA: Hidden Object Challenges", "name_original": "INK ENIGMA: Hidden Object Challenges", "description": "<p>Ink Enigma: Hidden Object Challenges turns every hand-drawn puzzle page into your personal sketchbook. Scan the scene, circle each secret, and watch the artwork come alive with your own signature ink.</p><p>Why It Feels So Good</p><p>Draw to Discover – Spot an item, press the trigger, and shhkk!—a lively marker-stroke wraps around it as if you sketched it yourself. A crisp checklist tick follows with an old-school paper-flip sound.</p><p>Page-Turner Puzzles – Enjoy a growing gallery of lovingly illustrated scenes, with even more discoveries planned for future updates.</p><p>Personal Best Timing – Every page records your fastest completion time, inviting you to out-ink your own record whenever inspiration strikes.</p><p>Your Marker, Your Style – Tweak opacity, thickness, and hue: go subtle pencil-grey or blaze neon—no two finished pages have to look the same.</p><p>Relax &amp; Recline – Warm parchment tones, gentle jazz-hop loops, zero jump-scares. Perfect for five-minute brain breaks or long, cozy play sessions.</p><p>Pick-Up-and-Play Controls – Controller, mouse, or touch—the UI instantly adapts to whatever you grab.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-08-22", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-08-25T09:43:06", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/616/6162aaa7907a970b90afaaf1cde74e57.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/c70/c707288e4176912a7da9ac79d90cdbc0.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 0, "added_by_status": null, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 5, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo"